{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/770408-where-is-the-infrastructure-in-your-neighborhood","id":770408,"title":"Where is the Infrastructure in your neighborhood?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-20T17:48:50-08:00","id":770408,"title":"Where is the Infrastructure in your neighborhood?","content":"I've been meaning to do so for quite some time, but I finally had the perfect combination of good weather and a free afternoon that this little project demanded of me. <a href=\"http://fourmoonspress.com/news/?p=1301\" target=\"_blank\">You can find the full post on my blog here.</a><br /> <br /> In short, there are a bunch of random things in my neighborhood that look like the God-Machine's Infrastructure (or lie it has some other connection to the occult in the World of Darkness). So I took some pictures, wrote a brief explanation of what about them made me think &quot;urban horror,&quot; and now I'm extending my invitation to all of you to tell me stories about these things or post pictures of the Infrastructure in <i>your</i> neighborhood.<br /> <br /> Here are just the photos and explanations:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fourmoonspress.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_0116-e1447621663882-768x1024.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> A bowling supply store (those still exist?), a Mercado, and a Masonic lodge (loudly announcing its presence with a huge sign?). Either this is the worst Concealment Infrastructure ever, or the Guardians of the Veil are trolling us.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fourmoonspress.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_0128-e1447625885350-768x1024.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I drive by these every day \u2013 sometimes multiple times a day. I walked by them multiple times while taking William to the playground. They are clearly visible from less than a block away from my house. I didn\u2019t notice them until I had lived here for <i>three years</i>, which still sort of weirds me out. Someone has spray-painted the letters UFO on the side. Somehow this only makes it even stranger that I didn\u2019t notice them before.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fourmoonspress.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_0122-e1447625794376-768x1024.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I\u2019m not sure whether this served a practical function at some point (the building behind it used to be a train station and is now a library) or whether it\u2019s someone\u2019s art project (this is at the heart of the art district). What makes it strange is that you can\u2019t see it from the street from any point within my neighborhood. It is only when you are standing across the river just beyond the border of the neighborhood that it is visible.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fourmoonspress.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_0126-e1447626981642-1024x768.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> A year ago there was a car wash here. It serves Tex Mex food but is decorated like an over-the-top country club. It has a Ferris wheel and a miniature golf course. A little odd, sure, but did you know that they didn\u2019t demolish the car wash? They actually built the restaurant around it.<br /> <br /> Alright, your turn. Tell me what these landmarks \u201creally\u201d are. Or post your own pictures of weird stuff around town.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T17:49:44-08:00","id":770409,"title":"","content":"The last two pictures got cut off due to limits on the number of pictures per post. Here they are:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fourmoonspress.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_0129-1024x768.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> This picture is a bit fuzzy. It\u2019s a drum store with an anti-theft steel grid inside its doors and windows. This isn\u2019t interesting in itself, but the history of the site makes it a bit more remarkable. In the first three years that we lived here, this building was a graveyard for small businesses. Whenever a new shop would open here, you could be sure it would go out of business within three months. The location was absolute poison for no discernible reason (most of the other businesses in the area appear to be thriving). Then this drum store set up shop, and it has mysteriously survived the last three years. I\u2019m not sure whether the owners are just plain more competent than the previous tenants or whether they just found a good exorcist soon after they moved in. Sorry the picture is upside-down, but I spent thirty minutes trying to get it to display properly, and it keeps showing up flipped the wrong way up. Make of that what you will.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fourmoonspress.com/news/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_0132-1024x768.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> This is Little Jack\u2019s. Longtime residents of the area tell me it was once one of the oldest restaurants in Minneapolis \u2013 an old school supper club that fell into its current sorry state after its original owners died. It has remained an island of blight in a sea of vibrant small businesses for decades. Soon after we moved here, a grand announcement went out to the neighborhood that a new owner had purchased the property and intended to develop it into a commercial and residential center. You can see they even put up a sign to show what it will look like once it\u2019s finished. It has been several years, and the building hasn\u2019t even been demolished yet, much less transformed into a new retail center. I\u2019m not sure what the hold-up is, but it\u2019s almost as if something or someone doesn\u2019t want anyone to tear down the Little Jack\u2019s building.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T23:22:32-08:00","id":770561,"title":"","content":"Every store in my mall's clocks are 30 seconds fast. If any one adjusts them they slowly go back to 30 seconds fast over the day. They use to be 30 seconds slow but not anymore...<br /> <br /> Weirdest part is the shift from slow to fast seemed to happen all at the same time.<br /> <br /> May not be what you are looking for but a few of the other workers in the mall know about wod and we joke about the god machine being responsible for that and every other weird thing that happens in our mall (at least something once every 1-3 months). Weird often as something big happens but no one is ever hurt. I could give a list but to be honest after a while you just don't notice. So there must be concealment infrastructure that has numbed our perception within the mall and every incident is but a reinforcement of the infrastructure...<br /> <br /> What I dare ask is it hiding in the depths of those twisted back hallways? What lay behind the countless doors I have never seen any enter or exit? Is that why I and others simply do not dare peak behind the doors or go into its hidden depths? Do we know in the back of our minds to keep our head down and ignore it like the denizens of the world of darkness?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T07:17:27-08:00","id":770709,"title":"","content":"There's this big processed tomato factory in front of my house that effectively only works summers and autumns. The rest of the time it's probably being used by the God-Machine, as you can still hear it work sometimes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T08:55:01-08:00","id":770762,"title":"","content":"I have nothing of my own to add here, other than the fact I read the thread's title to the tune of a certain Sesame Street song in my head...<br /> <br /> &quot;Where is the infrastructure in your neighborhood?<br /> In your neighborhood<br /> In your neigh-bor-hood<br /> Oh where's the infrastructure in your neighborhood?<br /> The God-Machine you see each day?&quot;<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T10:42:27-08:00","id":770826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/770408-where-is-the-infrastructure-in-your-neighborhood?p=770762#post770762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have nothing of my own to add here, other than the fact I read the thread's title to the tune of a certain Sesame Street song in my head...<br /> <br /> &quot;Where is the infrastructure in your neighborhood?<br /> In your neighborhood<br /> In your neigh-bor-hood<br /> Oh where's the infrastructure in your neighborhood?<br /> The God-Machine you see each day?&quot;<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not an accident, to be honest. I have a small child. I could distribute far worse earworms. *smirk*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T10:52:44-08:00","id":770835,"title":"","content":"I live next door to a small factory. It has exactly one shift everyday (even stat holidays) 8-4. It employs a good number of people for a small factory with only one shift a day, somewhere in the 50-60 range. Then it gets weird, despite living next door to it I don't know anyone who works there. Asking around town no one seems to. Further more no one knows what company owns the factory or what they make. I've tried making small talk with employees on break every now and again but they just brush me off. Also they test their fire alarm every Monday at 8:15, no one leaves the building they just run the alarm until 8:30 and then shut it off.<br /> <br /> Downtown by the harbor there is a large pole. About fifteen feet tall. On top of the pole is what looks like a wicker statue of growling dog. It is the only one of it's kind in the city and it sits there year round, even into the Christmas season when the rest of the harbor front is covered in Christmas lights and the creepy dog statue seems quite out of place. The lights go right up to the dog but do not touch it directly. This one strikes me more as something from Werewolf or Changeling but it's weird enough that it should probably be mentioned here too.<br /> <br /> At the corner of 10th St East and 2nd Ave East, pretty much the highest traffic corner in the city there is an unusual storefront. Most of the time is closed and empty but every now and again some aspiring entrepreneur buys it and opens a sub shop. It is always a sub shop, never any other type of restaurant or other business. Once it was a Mr. Sub but it otherwise has never been part of a major chain. These sub shops always fall to ruin in short order. One was shut down after the police found it to be a front for a drug ring. Another time it got shut down for health code violations. The Mr. Sub had it's franchise license pulled and closed shortly after for no known reason. The most recent incarnation got so desperate for funds that a few months before shutting down there were looking for staff as volunteers instead of paid employees.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9065-darkblade","name":"Darkblade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T15:42:56-08:00","id":771009,"title":"","content":"There's a cafe in York, England near to the Minster, a very tourist-y area, very profitable. Probably very expensive to rent. It is <i>never </i>open. I've pointed it out to several people, including my gaming group (who agreed that yes, it was obviously Infrastructure) and nobody has ever seen anyone inside. But it's not boarded up or anything - there are chairs and tables inside, menus in the windows that occasionally seem to update.<br /> <br /> But nobody has ever seen it open.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T11:00:32-08:00","id":781755,"title":"","content":"When you walk around town you often find unusual &quot;art projects&quot; around the place. <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/6phS7\" target=\"_blank\">http://imgur.com/a/6phS7</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9830-reshyshira","name":"ReshyShira","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9830_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T16:00:29-08:00","id":781909,"title":"","content":"At the bottom of the street where I live, there's a sort of weird electrical building. It's probably something completely normal, but it's interesting to me because of the thoughts it inspired in my young mind.<br /> <br /> When I was a kid, I always had nightmares about things going on in that building, or creatures coming out of it at night and dragging people back inside. It was really mysterious and I had never seen anyone go in or out, so my mind just filled in the gaps and made an interesting story out of it.<br /> Whenever I try to envision infrastructure, I always think of that building and what my mind thought was beyond those Do Not Enter doors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":203,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","user":"Kleptomania","date":". 12-07-2015, 07:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T17:25:49-08:00","id":781960,"title":"","content":"There's a building on my university campus that no one knows what it's for, some say it's an art project but it's just a tower sitting there. No one ever going in or out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-17T07:53:16-08:00","id":788102,"title":"","content":"Its not in my neighborhood but I saw this video on youtube and could not help but think this has to be a god machine Infrastructure<br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Propaganda Games: Sesame Credit - The True Danger of Gamification - Extra Credits</span></b><br /><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lHcTKWiZ8sI\" data-code=\"lHcTKWiZ8sI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/lHcTKWiZ8sI/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> This is quite an interesting god machine Infrastructure. It forces social control with just words on a computer screen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-17T11:21:35-08:00","id":788231,"title":"","content":"There used to be a Chinese restaurant in the shopping center near my house that was absolutely terrible, but managed to stay open for decades, despite everyone thinking it was terrible and much better Mexican and Japanese places being right next to it. Then one day it had been replaced by a different Chinese place with different owners (and this one had much better food). God Machine infrastructure is as good a guess as any in my opinion.<br /> <br /> Of course, the Mexican place is part of a local chain, though that particular location has a reputation for attracting the local misfits and weirdos (my family included, as well as a descendant of the less famous middle Grimm brother who is a drinking buddy of my mom.)<br /> <br /> There is also the fact that there are NO movie theaters in town, you have to go out of town to see a movie in the theater. In fact every entertainment business that caters to young people in town has gone under over time, including a roller rink, a gaming center, a comic shop and from what I hear there USED to be a movie theater in town, but it closed down before I was born. There is a new comic and gaming shop in town, but I am worried it might not make it either. I can't help but wonder if the GM is behind the whole thing about making young people hate the suburbs so that they will move back to the city.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-17T11:52:52-08:00","id":788248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/770408-where-is-the-infrastructure-in-your-neighborhood?p=788102#post788102\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Its not in my neighborhood but I saw this video on youtube and could not help but think this has to be a god machine Infrastructure<br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Propaganda Games: Sesame Credit - The True Danger of Gamification - Extra Credits</span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lHcTKWiZ8sI\" data-code=\"lHcTKWiZ8sI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/lHcTKWiZ8sI/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> This is quite an interesting god machine Infrastructure. It forces social control with just words on a computer screen.</div> </div> </div> </div>This would be really cool GMC/D:TD inspiration if it wasn't real. I mean, it's still good inspiration, but the fact that it isn't fictional takes it from creepy and cool to genuinely disturbing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 12-17-2015, 03:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-17T12:49:08-08:00","id":788282,"title":"","content":"...I'm not even sure what to say regarding that. &quot;Stranger than fiction&quot;? But it isn't strange - it is perfect understandable and predictable given current systems. I'm not sure if that makes it <i>worse</i> or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-17T12:51:47-08:00","id":788283,"title":"","content":"I've always found it interesting how the 'extreme' elements people roll their eyes at in the World of Darkness settings are considered over the top and grimdark, when they really pale in comparison to a lot of things happening in the real world.<br /> <br /> As for stuff in my neighborhood, there was a small strip mall in the middle of the area and it was always remarkable how it stayed in business. We later found out it was due to money laundering, but still.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-17-2015, 03:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-18T19:20:34-08:00","id":789075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/770408-where-is-the-infrastructure-in-your-neighborhood?p=788283#post788283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As for stuff in my neighborhood, there was a small strip mall in the middle of the area and it was always remarkable how it stayed in business. We later found out it was due to money laundering, but still.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well I guess there was something happening behind the scenes after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-19T20:59:31-08:00","id":789594,"title":"","content":"Up my street aways, there's a house in which, at least once every month, a meth lab is found. It's always a new tenant running it, but somehow, every time, it's a meth lab. I mean, I know Indiana is the Meth capital of the world, but it's getting kind of creepy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-22T13:18:39-08:00","id":791037,"title":"","content":"I grew up on a lot military bases so reading through this thread I realized that pretty much every example listed here can be found on an U.S. military base either overseas, or, continental. There are fast food outlets that stay in business despite never having business. Some bases have 70\u2019s era research facilities hidden in the woods that house state of the art equipment. One motor pool I saw blacked out at night and looked like a black hole at the center of completely lit base. Not to mention on top of these possible pieces of Infrastructure you have gates with armed guards who check I.D.\u2019s, canons/tanks often stationed around the base, and numerous other Defense Infrastructure. It might be too on the noise to house Infrastructure on a military base, but it would be impressive if a group of Unchained could come up with a creative way to actually get through all of that security to an internal target without Going Loud.<br /> Away from that, I have been thinking about how often the God Machine\u2019s Infrastructure has a heavy industrial flavor to its aesthetic. Living in Baltimore for the past five years, I have seen my share of buildings that could easily be described as Infrastructure (heck 83 south into the city is such ridiculous design I swear that it is used by the God Machine to collect broken cars fused with human fear), but what I have recently seen as possible forms of God Machine Infrastructure has been much more trendy and hip. You look at a neighborhood like Hampden; it is an old working class neighborhood that has seen its share of racial tension since the closing of numerous union job markets in the city. The neighborhood has always had an artsy feel to it, with a few shops and restaurants that stood out in the area.<br /> Over the past decade, there has been a boom of eclectic businesses on the main strip making the area a hub for young wealth focused development. At the heart of this is a single man. I\u2019ll call him the Mayor of Hampden so as to not use his name. He is an enigmatic and eccentric financier who has spear headed investment into local ice cream parlors and gastro pubs. If you meet him he will be wearing running shorts regardless of the weather/occasion. He goes by a name that isn\u2019t his own and won\u2019t tell you his age. Not to mention he gets around the neighborhood on a tricycle with streamers. In spite of this description this man is influential and has brought prosperity to the area (perhaps at the cost of the original inhabitants). With all of this attention and money a brand new condo and shopping center is being built right in the middle of the historic neighborhood.<br /> What I am trying to get at with that is simply that what if what the God Machine is making isn\u2019t what we think is out of the ordinary, but what we love and enjoy. What if angels wear shorts in the winter, but brought to your area the bar you love the most. How would an unchained deal with Infrastructure that very well could be insidious, but is completely enjoyable and normal to everyone. Wouldn\u2019t the best Concealment Infrastructure be the one where humans had just enough freedom to feel powerful and individual.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T09:04:07-08:00","id":794878,"title":"","content":"My best friend once sneaked into an abandoned house in her neighborhood as a kid. Every wall on the ground floor was covered in clocks. The house had no power and had been abandoned for as long as she could remember, but all the clocks were running.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2573-inkpenavenger","name":"inkpenavenger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2573_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T21:59:48-08:00","id":795383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>inkpenavenger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/770408-where-is-the-infrastructure-in-your-neighborhood?p=794878#post794878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My best friend once sneaked into an abandoned house in her neighborhood as a kid. Every wall on the ground floor was covered in clocks. The house had no power and had been abandoned for as long as she could remember, but all the clocks were running.</div> </div> </div> </div>Run. I don't care where you are in the present day in relation to that house, but angels are probably coming for the both of you. That is some freaky shit, and you need to run.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T13:19:22-08:00","id":801575,"title":"","content":"I live in NYC and I'm sure that the G-Train is an infrastructure<br /> <img src=\"https://40.media.tumblr.com/24c9483ebb4b84f0cf81aabe5f4769be/tumblr_o0i0h2RIL91rxzv9qo2_1280.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> <img src=\"https://41.media.tumblr.com/43ad29cab0cd66b26a985cfd8d2284fa/tumblr_o0i0h2RIL91rxzv9qo1_500.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T17:02:24-08:00","id":802460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/770408-where-is-the-infrastructure-in-your-neighborhood?p=801575#post801575\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <img src=\"https://41.media.tumblr.com/43ad29cab0cd66b26a985cfd8d2284fa/tumblr_o0i0h2RIL91rxzv9qo1_500.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>Wow.<br /> <br /> Probably in my town, its the size of some buildings. There's about 3 buildings that have no stairs going up, no ladders, nothing. But there is still a second story. Probably some of them are passages, but still, its weird. I've also seen stores that never open, even if people swear that they remember seeing people in it once. I once saw someone walk behind a thicket of bushes and not reappear. I even looked behind them, but there was nothing.<br /> There is more changeling stuff around my town, but this is the infrastructure I can remember.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10751-belac93","name":"Belac93","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10751_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}